[44.953, "o", "{\"advice\":\"This week, try adding moderate physical activity like brisk walking most days if comfortable. Aim to build stamina with aerobic activity, and include strength exercises like sit-to-stand or wall push-ups twice a week. This helps manage your elevated blood glucose, maintain muscle, and support independence safely. On hazy days, opt for indoor activities like mall walking or home routines to stay active safely.\",\"confidence\":\"high\",\"supporting_guides\":[\"lg-10-active-after-60\",\"lg-06-exercise-by-condition\",\"lg-09-hazy-day-activity\"],\"rationale\":\"You are aged 60-64 with elevated blood glucose and currently low steps and MVPA. Increasing safe, manageable physical activity fits your health needs and age, while considering your region's hazy conditions.\",\"personalisation_flags\":[\"age_60_64\",\"elevated_blood_glucose\",\"low_steps\",\"hazy_region\"]}\r\n"]
[44.969, "o", "   [PASS ] lab3_profile_tailored: profile tool called -- ['get_citizen_profile', 'memory:search_call', 'knowledge_base_retrieve', 'memory:search_call']\r\n"]
