[173.281, "o", "{\"advice\":\"I have signed you up for the Morning Chair Strength & Balance session at Woodlands Community Club on Tuesdays at 8:30 am. It's a light-intensity, indoor activity suitable for beginners and seniors, perfect for mornings and suitable during hazy conditions. This will help you stay active safely indoors.\",\"confidence\":\"high\",\"supporting_guides\":[\"lg-02-physical-activity-guideline\",\"lg-06-exercise-by-condition\"],\"rationale\":\"The activity matches your preference for indoor morning exercises near Woodlands, avoiding swimming and considering conditions for seniors and beginners. It suits hazy day safety recommendations.\",\"personalisation_flags\":[\"prefers_indoor\",\"prefers_mornings\"]}\r\n"]
