[321.156, "o", "{\"advice\":\"The region with the highest share of disengaged residents is the North, followed by the West, Central, East, and North-East regions. Specifically, about 20% of residents in the North are disengaged, while the West has about 17.1%, Central 13.1%, East 11.7%, and North-East 8.3%.\",\"confidence\":\"high\",\"supporting_guides\":[],\"rationale\":\"This information is based on aggregate data of resident engagement across regions, showing the highest disengagement in the North region.\",\"personalisation_flags\":[]}\r\n"]
